<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay together</i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>lie with</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικί</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.181
			</span></i>; of the woman, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστιν ἥτις τῷδε -κλιθήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1090
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>lean, incline</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς εὐνοίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					7.11.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inflect similarly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				102.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκεκλιμένου τοῦ σκέλεος</span>,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκεκαμμένου</span> (which is v.l.),
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				60
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
